ade-voice — third-party notices
================================================================================

This package redistributes third-party software. The notices below travel with
it because the binary does: `bin/whisper-cli-darwin-universal` is a build of
whisper.cpp (statically linked against ggml), and MIT requires its copyright
notice to accompany every copy.

These sections were carried over from ADE's own NOTICE when voice dictation
moved out of the app and into this plugin. If the binary is ever replaced or
another platform's build is added, this file is what has to be updated with it.

